                    "numoutlets": 0,
                    "patching_rect": [
                        15.0,
                        205.0,
                        510.0,
                        33.0
                    ],
                    "text": "A: pick a source and turn the Gain dial in the bpatcher, fast. Compare with a bare *~ fed straight from a number box: that one crackles."
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
                    "fontname": "Arial",
                    "fontsize": 12.0,
