                        15.0,
                        250.0,
                        560.0,
                        33.0
                    ],
                    "text": "B: the core's gain inlet also takes a signal. Here a cycle~ swings the gain between -24 and 0 dB (tremolo). B starts silent at its own Gain dial (-72): turn it up, turn A down, then change the rate."
                }
            },
            {
                "box": {
